\f1\fs22 There were, of course, no direct routes to anywhere in the ants\'92 nest that was the Ruined Castle facility, and the pentad flew many false routes, eliminating each as they went. As they negotiated curving corridors and junctions, the drones avoided the little human activity occurring at that time of Christmas morning.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 They accelerated to top speed when they found at a passage wide enough for two trucks to pass without the drivers folding in a mirror. The whirring of their props reverberated off the black ceiling and rough-rendered concrete walls kilometres ahead.\
At the end, a pair of heavy doors blocking their path to the Washing Machine. They took formation, their motion describing the same vertical elliptical locus. Their Gyges discs spun up to speed. A dimensional collapse warped the doors and ripped their hinges. The pentad flew in and took position above the Washing Machine.\
And that\'92s when Sarah\'92s waters broke.
